  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening local development from a holistic perspective of human rights in the district three-Manrique (Medellin, Colombia) through the establishment of an association for local development.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sumapaz will work with 60 community leaders drawn from 150 grassroots groups and representatives of three community-based networks in Comuna 3, a neighborhood in Medellin, toward developing skills in planning, cooperation, conflict resolution and the promotion of human rights. It will also create an information center whose operations will be funded by the municipality of Medellin.</narrative>
  </description>
